  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "• 『新機動戦記ガンダム W』よりヒイロ・ユイが搭乗した主人公機をHGの最新フォーマットで立体化。",
      "en": "• From \"Mobile Suit Gundam W\", the main character aircraft piloted by Heero Yui has been made into 3D in HG's latest format."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 胸部インテークなど特徴的なデザインを忠実に再現。",
      "en": "• Faithfully reproduces distinctive designs such as the chest intake."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• メインカメラや胸部中央はクリアパーツを使用。",
      "en": "• Clear parts are used for the main camera and the center of the chest."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ウイングは展開・収納ギミックを搭載。ウイングを開いたダイナミックなアクションポーズが再現可能。",
      "en": "• The wing is equipped with an expansion and storage gimmick. A dynamic action pose with the wings open can be recreated."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• バード形態への変形も可能。",
      "en": "• Can also transform into bird form."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 大型のバスターライフルとビームサーベル２本が付属。",
      "en": "• Includes a large buster rifle and two beam sabers."
    }
